  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "We apply the power of quotient rule and simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{(-\\frac{a}{b})}^{3}{(\\frac{c}{d})}^{2} & = \\\\ \\frac{(-a)^{3}}{{b}^{3}}\\cdot \\frac{{c}^{2}}{{d}^{2}} & = \\\\ \\frac{-{a}^{3}}{{b}^{3}}\\cdot \\frac{{c}^{2}}{{d}^{2}} & = \\\\ -\\frac{{a}^{3}{c}^{2}}{{b}^{3}{d}^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
